#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Worker tuning is done via `TASK_WORKER_*` environment variables. All of "
"them have sane defaults for local development — set them in production as"
" needed."
msgstr ""
"Le réglage du worker se fait via les variables d'environnement "
"`TASK_WORKER_*`. Toutes ont des valeurs par défaut raisonnables pour le "
"développement local — configurez-les en production selon vos besoins."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Défaut"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Usage"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Threads processing tasks in parallel."
msgstr "Threads traitant les tâches en parallèle."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_STALE_MINUTES`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`5`"
msgstr "`5`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"A task stuck `RUNNING` (worker crash/OOM) is recovered to `READY` after "
"this many minutes."
msgstr ""
"Une tâche bloquée en `RUNNING` (crash/OOM du worker) est remise à `READY` "
"après ce nombre de minutes."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_BACKOFF_BASE_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`30`"
msgstr "`30`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Base delay for exponential backoff between retries."
msgstr "Délai de base du backoff exponentiel entre les réessais."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_HEARTBEAT_S`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Fallback polling interval while waiting on `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (covers "
"deferred tasks whose `run_after` has just elapsed)."
msgstr ""
"Intervalle de polling de secours en attendant `LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` (couvre "
"les tâches différées dont le `run_after` vient d'être dépassé)."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_DB_ALIAS`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"default\"`"
msgstr "`\"default\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Which `DATABASES` alias the worker connects through. Point this at a "
"separate alias (with its own pool sized for `TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + "
"1`) if you don't want the worker sharing a connection pool with your web "
"process."
msgstr ""
"L'alias `DATABASES` par lequel le worker se connecte. Pointez ceci vers "
"un alias séparé (avec son propre pool dimensionné pour "
"`TASK_WORKER_CONCURRENCY + 1`) si vous ne voulez pas que le worker "
"partage un connection pool avec votre processus web."

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"
msgstr "`TASK_WORKER_SPAN_PREFIX`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`\"django_task_psql\"`"
msgstr "`\"django_task_psql\"`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid ""
"Prefix for OpenTelemetry span names (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). Only "
"relevant if the `otel` extra is installed."
msgstr ""
"Préfixe pour les noms de span OpenTelemetry (`<prefix>.<task_path>`). "
"Pertinent uniquement si l'extra `otel` est installé."

#: ../../configuration.md:14
msgid ""
"A CLI flag (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) always overrides its "
"corresponding environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Un flag CLI (`--concurrency`, `--queues`) est toujours prioritaire sur la "
"variable d'environnement correspondante."
